msgctxt "92"
msgid "Ungh! How the hell did that just happen...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Amazing how you rounded up so many thugs, only to have them scatter like "
"rats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Ouch, that hurts. I've been abandoned before... The last time, I was one of "
"the thugs in the crowd, and my family abandoned us all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I relentlessly trained myself until I was sure of my strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I focused solely on honing myself and my skills for the sake of my family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"As I became stronger, they started giving me work that was even more "
"important. It gave me purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "One day, we got into a big showdown with a rival family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I thought my role was gonna be assassinating their key players, since I'd "
"been given those kinds of important roles before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "But it turns out I was just another disposable pawn to them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I was treated just like all the other guys in the crowd, like the ones who "
"only caused trouble and partied all the time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I couldn't take it. I gave everything to my family, but I'd lost all hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "What was all that effort even for? It really got to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "I understand what you're getting at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Sadly, that sort of thing happens all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"When it's an all-out conflict, everybody⑬even the boss⑬has his life on the "
"line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "You can't split hairs over those situations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "You feel like you wasted all that hard work, is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Well, you managed to survive the fight, didn't you? Isn't that what matters "
"most?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Even though you're not in the family anymore, you can still rely on that "
"strength you worked so hard to build up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "A man who was truly strong wouldn't obsess over some half-baked revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "What is real strength to you? Think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "You might have a point..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "I always trained my body, but I may have neglected my heart and mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Maybe the HLA can help me take a good, hard look at myself again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Are you Gohren?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Yeah. That's me. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "I'm with the Honest Living Association. I'm here to talk to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "So you're the guy who's been rounding up my buddies for the HLA, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "I'm impressed, I gotta admit. But you've been getting a little carried away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"My boss isn't too happy about all this. He ordered me to destroy the HLA by "
"any means necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"On top of that, he told me to find the bastard who's been capturing our men "
"and tear him limb from limb. Looks like that bastard is you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I think I'll just carry out my second set of orders first, get you crossed "
"off my to-do list..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "And there are fifty other guys here who all second that motion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Think you stand a chance against us?"
msgstr ""

